#: src/modules/Clientfence/Health.php
msgid "The release file list (library/ClientFence/release-files.json) is missing, so only :count pack files were checked. Install the ClientFence release again."
msgstr "Zoznam súborov vydania (library/ClientFence/release-files.json) chýba, preto bolo skontrolovaných iba :count súborov balíka. Nainštalujte vydanie ClientFence znova."

